{"id":1110701,"name":"콜란·심문 I","type":"Interrogation","scenes":[{"id":1,"name":"콜란·심문 I","code_name":"","dialogue_ids":[1110701]}],"trial":{"trial_id":110701,"stage":"1단계","unlock_time":"2024-06-06 14:00:00","diary1":"MBCC는 신디케이트 거리의 갱단들이 변이 무기 쟁탈전을 벌일 계획이라는 정보를 입수했다. 최근 수감자 콜란이 보였던 이상 행동들이 모두 그녀가 이번 사건과 밀접한 관련이 있다는 것을 말해주고 있었다.","diary2":"콜란이 강철파의 일원이었다는 게 밝혀졌다. 그녀는 여전히 많은 것을 숨기고 있는 듯했지만, MBCC는 이미 이번 쟁탈전의 목표를 잠정 파악하여, 더욱 철저한 대응을 할 수 있게 됐다.","evidence":[{"ID":260577,"Num":1}],"usable_items":[{"ID":260578,"Num":1}],"reward":[{"ID":240001,"Num":50}],"obey_award":100,"qte_failure":0,"failure_step":0,"graph":[{"step":1,"course":2,"dialogue_id":210701001,"next":null},{"step":2,"course":2,"dialogue_id":210701002,"next":null},{"step":3,"course":2,"dialogue_id":210701003,"next":null},{"step":4,"course":2,"dialogue_id":210701004,"next":null},{"step":5,"course":2,"dialogue_id":210701005,"next":null},{"step":6,"course":2,"dialogue_id":210701006,"next":null},{"step":7,"course":2,"dialogue_id":210701007,"next":null},{"step":8,"course":2,"dialogue_id":210701008,"next":null},{"step":9,"course":2,"dialogue_id":210701009,"next":null},{"step":10,"course":2,"dialogue_id":210701010,"next":null},{"step":11,"course":2,"dialogue_id":210701011,"next":null},{"step":12,"course":2,"dialogue_id":210701012,"next":null},{"step":13,"course":2,"dialogue_id":210701013,"next":null},{"step":14,"course":2,"dialogue_id":210701014,"next":null},{"step":15,"course":2,"dialogue_id":210701015,"next":null},{"step":16,"course":2,"dialogue_id":210701016,"next":null},{"step":17,"course":2,"dialogue_id":210701017,"next":null},{"step":18,"course":2,"dialogue_id":210701018,"next":null},{"step":19,"course":2,"dialogue_id":210701019,"next":null},{"step":20,"course":2,"dialogue_id":210701020,"next":null},{"step":21,"course":2,"dialogue_id":210701021,"next":null},{"step":22,"course":2,"dialogue_id":210701022,"next":null},{"step":23,"course":16,"dialogue_id":null,"next":null},{"step":24,"course":2,"dialogue_id":2107010